extends baseEmail

block content

    h2 Congratulations #{firstName}! 🎉

    p
        | Great news! All submitted travel documents have been successfully verified by our verification team.

    p
        | Your booking has now progressed to the next stage of the confirmation process.

    table(role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:25px 0;")
        tbody
            tr
                td(style="font-weight:bold;width:180px;") Booking Number
                td= book.bookingNumber

            tr
                td(style="font-weight:bold;") Tour
                td= book?.tour?.name || book?.tour?.slug

            tr
                td(style="font-weight:bold;") Verification Status
                td Verified

    h3 Next Steps

    p
        | To complete your booking, please contact our booking team using the number below for payment confirmation and ticket processing.

    table(role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="14" cellspacing="0" style="background:#EFF6FF;border-left:4px solid #2563EB;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;")
        tbody
            tr
                td
                    strong Booking Support
                    br
                    | #{contactPhone}

    p
        | Once your payment has been confirmed, our team will begin preparing your travel package, including:

    ul
        li Flight or transport tickets
        li Hotel confirmations
        li Travel itinerary
        li Travel vouchers (if applicable)

    p
        | Thank you for choosing
        strong  Natours
        | . We look forward to helping you create an unforgettable travel experience.

    p
        strong Natours Booking Team